/// Each viewer sees the people at or under them in the org chart, as the dashboard does, and only what those people did:
/// the sites they read and the agents they used. LicensePool, ValueNames and DepartmentWeek hold figures for the whole
/// organization, so they show only to viewers who see the whole organization.
/// Add the report's viewers (or an Entra group) to this role in the Power BI service.
role Organization
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission Users = Users[UserKey] IN CALCULATETABLE ( VALUES ( OrgSecurity[UserKey] ), OrgSecurity[ViewerUpn] = USERPRINCIPALNAME () )

	tablePermission OrgSecurity = OrgSecurity[ViewerUpn] = USERPRINCIPALNAME ()

	tablePermission LicensePool = NOT ISEMPTY ( CALCULATETABLE ( OrgSecurity, OrgSecurity[ViewerUpn] = USERPRINCIPALNAME (), OrgSecurity[WholeOrganization] = TRUE () ) )

	tablePermission ValueNames = NOT ISEMPTY ( CALCULATETABLE ( OrgSecurity, OrgSecurity[ViewerUpn] = USERPRINCIPALNAME (), OrgSecurity[WholeOrganization] = TRUE () ) )

	tablePermission DepartmentWeek = NOT ISEMPTY ( CALCULATETABLE ( OrgSecurity, OrgSecurity[ViewerUpn] = USERPRINCIPALNAME (), OrgSecurity[WholeOrganization] = TRUE () ) )
